"Fed only by what this phone itself observes: sweeps it ran, announcements it heard, knocks at its own door. An address is a character, never a person — and nothing here is followed off this network." = "Alimentado solo por lo que este teléfono mismo observa: barridos que ejecutó, anuncios que oyó, golpes a sus propias puertas.";
