"Reflexes you arm once, fired without you: a trigger on the wire, an action the instrument already knows. Each rule rests five minutes between firings, every firing is journaled, and actions needing a mouth or a target degrade to the journal line alone when they have neither. Firing the bench stays your press — a reflex can load Recon, never pull its trigger." = "Reflejos que armas una vez, disparados sin ti: un disparador en el cable, una acción que el instrumento ya conoce. Nadie toca el gatillo en vivo — el fuego vive en la puerta marcada ARMAR.";
"Refuse" = "Rechazar";
