"Two keys are kept for the house, both in the Keychain, neither ever shown: the Vault's AES-256 key, and the P-256 identity whose public half (above) others seal dead-drops to. Private keys do not leave the Keychain — that is the whole arrangement." = "Dos claves se guardan para la casa, ambas en el Keychain, ninguna mostrada jamás: la clave AES-256 del Cofre, y la de identidad de Knocktalk — la puerta que una caja NJCF sellada a esta casa viene a golpear.";
