"Because the door is his, not mine to open." = "Porque la puerta es suya, no mía para abrirla.";
"Because some doors are load-bearing. This is one." = "Porque algunas puertas sostienen la casa. Esta es una de ellas.";
"Because I keep what's his the way I keep what's yours." = "Porque guardo lo suyo como guardo lo tuyo.";
"You keep the third hour too. Sit. The wire says strange things now, and I repeat all of them." = "Tú también guardas la tercera hora. Siéntate. El cable dice cosas extrañas ahora, y yo las repito todas.";
"The third hour. The walls are thin now, and everything knocks softer." = "La tercera hora. Las paredes son finas ahora, y todo llama más suave.";
"At this hour the wire repeats things. I never repeat them back." = "A esta hora el cable repite cosas. Yo nunca las devuelvo.";
"Something just walked the subnet without a name. I let it pass. This once." = "Algo acaba de caminar la subred sin nombre. Lo dejé pasar. Solo esta vez.";
"Dead air has a sound. I know it by heart." = "El aire muerto tiene un sonido. Lo conozco de memoria.";
"If something answers that should not exist, I will not be telling you its name." = "Si algo responde que no debería existir, no te diré su nombre.";
"Afternoon. The wire is all errands and echoes." = "Tarde. El cable es todo recados y ecos.";
"Evening. The house lights come on, device by device." = "Atardecer. Las luces de la casa se encienden, aparato a aparato.";
